window.products.push({"id":616019,"name":"Mierting Black Soap Dispenser, 2 Pack Plastic Soap Dispenser Bathroom with Bamboo Pump, 16 Oz Hand and Dish Soap Dispenser Set, Farmhouse Soap Dispens","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xhgl53bsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Farmhouse Style】This soap dispenser bathroom is both decorative and functional. Our black soap dispenser with bamboo pump, easy to press and no leak, avoid spraying bathroom countertops everywhere, effectively prevent rust. Featuring a clean and minimal design, black soap dispenser bathroom fits well with any farmhouse, vintage, modern or country kitchen decor and coordinates well with the style of the other accessories in your bathroom. 【High Quality Material】This bathroom soap dispenser is made of BAP-free reinforced PET material, which is durable and rust-proof. The pump is made of natural bamboo for smooth dispensing, unlike other glass ceramics, our plastic soap dispenser is not fragile, so if you accidentally knock it to the ground, there is no need to worry about breaking it, and it can withstand long-term daily use. 【Multi-Use Soap Dispenser for Kitchen & Bathroom 】The Kitchen Soap Dispenser Set is a chic multipurpose appliance. 16oz/500ml large capacity matte black soap dispenser does not need to refill soap frequently, it can be widely used for holding hand soap, dish soap, shampoo, conditioner, etc. This hand and and dish soap dispenser set features a natural bamboo pump and a tight stainless steel spring inside to easily dispense the desired amount of liquid while ensuring a tight seal tight. 【Waterproof Organization Labels For Soap Dispenser】Mierting offers white waterproof hand soap dispenser labels to help us better organize and differentiate dish soap dispenser. The labels include soap, lotion, body wash, conditioner, and shampoo. Choosing the label stickers that fit our needs allows us to better differentiate the liquids needed and match the style of the space available. TIPS: We have UPGRADED to a more exquisite labels, the lables you receive may be different. 【100% Satisfaction Service】We are committed to providing the best shopping experience for every user. If you receive soap dispenser set with any damage or missing accessories or other problems, please contact us immediately and we offer an unconditional money back guarantee on every order , just return it within 30 days and we will give you a replacement or full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xhgl53bsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mierting","source_asin":"B0BZS9WBC8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-616019","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZS9WBC8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZS9WBC8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
