window.products.push({"id":616159,"name":"SmartDevil Portable Camping Fan with Light, 10000mAh Rechargeable Tent Fan with Hanging Hook, Battery Operated Desk Fan Use As Power Bank, 180+360 Deg","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wKn7lFUsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【4 Speeds & 3 Lights】One button to switch four different wind speeds, this camping fan is designed for outside. Equipped bright LEDs with 3 brightness settings, you can set the bright mode as lantern during camping, set dim as nightlight for sleeping, illuminate a camper or a small room during night/ in darkness. 【180+360 Degree Rotation】This travel fan with 180+360 degree rotation, you can adjust the wind direction of the fan at will. Extremely convenient and practical for camping, RV, picnic and tent. 【Portable Fan as Power Bank】Built-in 10000mAh battery, the rechargeable battery operated fan can work for up to 32 hours after full charge(Speed 1). With 2 charging ports (in&out), not only applying as desk fan, but also using as a power bank, which provides the backup power source for your mobile device, such as smartphone, laptop. 【Hook & Aroma Diffuser】This portable fan is equipped with easy-to-open hidden hook, so you can hang the fan on the tents, branches or inside a car.The front cover is covered with aromatherapy cotton, you can drop the essential oil you want as needed. 【Portable & Compact】The travel fan is of portable size(5.98*6.29*8.54 Inches), easy to take on the go and store.Perfect for outside.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wKn7lFUsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SmartDevil","source_asin":"B09WDM3SDD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-616159","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WDM3SDD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WDM3SDD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":616160,"name":"Protect a Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417fMYt2+1L._AC_.jpg","description":"Protect A Pan™ cookware covers are non toxic, made of natural fibers and are environmentally friendly. No worries as to what has touched your cooking surface while stored in your kitchen cabinet or drawer. Whether that might be from the bottom of another pan, dust, fingerprints, animal droppings or the residue of a synthetic protector. Protect A Pan™ keeps it the way you left it - clean! Great for campers, recreational vehicles, and boats. Eliminates that shake, rattle and roll while traveling. Decorative cover to enhance your kitchen design. Easy to use and makes a Great Gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417fMYt2+1L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Protect a Pan","source_asin":"B000Y1QVDU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-616160","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000Y1QVDU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000Y1QVDU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":616161,"name":"Nordic Ware Deluxe Deco Set, 12 discs and 6 tips, Sea Glass","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nxRaGRyoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A 2-in-1 tool for people who love to bake! It's a dough press for classic spritz cookies or a beautifully precise frosting tool for topping cupcakes, cookies, cakes and more. Features exclusive easy-to-use, push-down, click-reset lever that eliminates guesswork and hand/wrist fatigue since there is no squeezing involved. Comes with 12 distinct spritz cookie discs and 6 unique frosting tips. Material: ABS Plastic, polypropylene, stainless steel. Use and Care: 1. Before initial and after subsequent uses, hand wash with warm soapy water and dry thoroughly. 2. For best spritz cookie results, use a cooled, natural aluminum baking sheet. Do not use parchment paper or nonstick pans. 3. Not recommended for use with refrigerated dough. 4. Do not force the trigger. If the dough is too stiff, let the dough sit at room temperature in the press for 10-15 minutes to soften. 5. For best results, use a thicker frosting. To Form Spritz Cookies: 1. Turn knob so teeth on metal rod of plunger are facing away from the handle. Pull rod out to bring the plunger to the top of barrel. The smooth side of the metal rod should be facing the same direction as the handle. 2. Unscrew threaded ring at opposite end of barrel. 3. Form dough into log and insert into barrel. Insert your choice of spritz disc into threaded ring and gently screw the ring on to the barrel to secure. 4. Press plunger down gently to remove air. Rotate knob 180° so teeth on metal rod are facing towards the handle. 5. Hold press upright with ring resting ﬁrmly against a cooled, ungreased aluminum baking sheet. 6. Squeeze the trigger to form a cookie. One click makes one cookie, two clicks will form a thicker cookie. 7. Repeat with remainder of dough in press. Once barrel is empty, repeat steps above to reﬁll. To Decorate with Frosting: 1. Turn knob so teeth on metal rod of plunger are facing away from the handle. Pull rod out to bring the plunger to the top of barrel. The smooth side of the metal rod should be facing the same direction as the handle. 2. Unscrew threaded ring at opposite end of barrel. Carefully ﬁll with thick buttercream frosting; thin frosting will not hold the designs as well. 3. Insert your choice of decorating tip into threaded ring and gently screw the ring on the barrel to secure. 4. Gently push metal rod to decorate. Change tips to vary designs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nxRaGRyoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nordic Ware","source_asin":"B08YSC7SLH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-616161","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YSC7SLH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YSC7SLH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
