window.products.push({"id":616272,"name":"Uppetly Rice Airtight Dry Food Storage Containers, BPA Free Plastic Storage Bin Dispenser with Pourable Spout, Measuring cup for Cereal, Flour and Bak","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Jv3AiyxSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECT for KITCHEN and PANTRY STORAGE: this rice storage container also fit for Cereal, Flour, Snacks, Nuts and Baking Supplies. The airtight seal lid which ensure to keep your food dry and fresh. Include a Stainless Steel Whisk for you to do the Baking. It can make your Kitchen neatly organized. You will have a good mood to do cooks every day PORTABLE POURING with HAND GRIP: this small and convient container wich can storage around 2.5KG rice.It designed with ergonomic grip. Food can be poured directly out of the mouth. Reduce the steps to open the lid. The measuring cup can help you check how much food you get. Portable handle for you to take it go anywhere you want CLEAR and AIRTIGHT CONTAINERS: it's a really clear plastic container. You can identify the contents without opening them. 4-sided locking lid with silicone seal.It seals really well so you don't need to worry that your cereal goes stales. Measuring cup can screw on over the pour spout. It also can keep out of mice, rats, insects and other pests away BPA FREE & DURABLE: made of high quality food grade BPA free materials. You won't have to worry about the health of your family. Durable and shatterproof, we have tested the storage container body ensure it to be strong and durable enough for long-lasting use EASY to WASH + 100% GUARANTEE: this light weight premium quality plastic container which is easy to wash by hand and also safe clean in dishwasher. If you or your family member aren't satisfied with it, please go to your order page and CONTACT US. We can offer free replacement or full refund upon your demand","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Jv3AiyxSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Uppetly","source_asin":"B09BC7LYM8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-616272","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BC7LYM8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BC7LYM8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":616273,"name":"Digital Meat Thermometer Fork for Grilling and Barbecue Very Fast Read with Electronic Ready Alarm Quick Accurate Temperature for Any Grilled Food, St","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.56,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dm9rwVk7L._SL1024_.jpg","description":"TIRED OF MESSING UP YOUR BARBEQUE? When it comes to grilling meat, trying to get it just right is not always easy. You know from experience that using sight and touch to determine the readiness of your meat is never enough. You often end up with a batch that pleases some people but gets complaints from others. Wouldn’t it be nice if you could have a tool that will help you become more consistent with your grilling results? ELIMINATES THE GUESSWORK It’s hard to tell if a piece of meat is ready just by looking at it. Our meat thermometer takes away the guesswork, ensuring you get it perfect every time. It comes with a flashing doneness indicator that lets you know when your steak is ready. THE DIGITAL ADVANTAGE Our digital thermometer takes ease of use to the next level. It provides meat choices and taste settings. Simply choose the setting you prefer and wait for the sound of an alarm to tell you your grilled food is good to go. This meat thermometer also comes with a large lighted screen, making it easy to see the temperature even when it’s dark. AVOID OVERCOOKING Our digital thermometer helps ensure you’re sticking with the right temperature, allowing the meat to stay juicy and tender. To ensure accurate reading, make sure you are sticking the thermometer into the thickest part of the meat. ENJOY DELICIOUS STEAKS With our meat thermometer, you no longer have to go to fancy restaurants to enjoy a delicious steak. You can consistently have your own delicious cuts at home! Our meat thermometer comes with a bonus eBook that will help you master the art of barbecuing. NEVER WASTE GOOD MEAT AGAIN One important advantage of using our digital thermometer is that you’ll never end up with wasted meat again. Messing up your barbecue after you’ve put in all the work can be a real bummer. It’s a waste of effort, time and money as well.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dm9rwVk7L._SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grille Perfect","source_asin":"B08STSLVVG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-616273","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08STSLVVG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08STSLVVG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
