window.products.push({"id":616278,"name":"Casatec™ Cool Mist Humidifier 2-in-1 Air Humidifier and Essential Oil Diffuser {3 Liter} Auto Shut-Off, 3 Mode, Quiet Operation, Ultrasonic Humidifier","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812t0Fs1EgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2-IN-1 HUMIDIFIER AND DIFFUSER - An efficient and helpful 2-in-1 room humidifier designed to cover two of your needs at the same time. The convenient desk humidifier by Casatac silently blows a continuous cool mist while simultaneously making the space smell fresh and fragrant. CONVENIENT TOP-FILL DESIGN - The handy bedroom humidifier is designed for convenience and ease of use. It has a suitable top fill design to allow you to quickly fill the large tank with ease. The capacity makes the large humidifier ideal for bedrooms, nurseries, and other similar spaces. THREE MODES SETTINGS - The cool humidifier has not one but three mist control settings. You can either keep the mist output to low, medium or high depending on your mood or need. The three settings make it easier to adjust the amount of mist needed for any specific room. CALMING AROMATHERAPY - The easy clean humidifier doubles as a diffuser allowing you to use it for relaxing aromatherapy. The package also includes three aromatic sponges that can be used with different essential oils to provide a pleasant and calming aroma while the humidifier is active. AUTO SHUT-OFF / WARRANTY - For added safety, the air humidifier for bedroom is equipped with an auto shut-off feature. It has a 20 hour run time and automatically shuts down when there is no water remaining. You also get a two-year extended replacement warranty with your purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812t0Fs1EgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CASATEC","source_asin":"B09HY367X9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-616278","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HY367X9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HY367X9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":616279,"name":"Japanese Rice Washing Bowl with Side and Bottom Drainers (10\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ubivPRWnL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"This unique washing bowl is the perfect hybrid between a regular strainer and a bowl as it was specifically designed for the purpose of washing Japanese rice. Japanese rice can be particularly time consuming to prepare as you need to wash the rice with your hand in a bowl or pot, giving it a good swirl around before rinsing it out. And you actually have to do this repeatedly until the water is clear so unless you have loads of free time you may not be able to do it well and end up with less than desirable results. However, this washing bowl enables you to swiftly prepare your rice up to Japanese standards with considerable ease. The tricky part of carefully pouring out the water without pouring out your rice is no longer necessary as the water will drain from the bottom a bit slower than a regular strainer, allowing the water and your hand to effectively clean the rice before it goes completely through. Yet this all happens still fast enough for you to save a lot of time compared to washing rice the traditional way with a bowl or pot where you would have to slowly drain the water out over and over. Notably, this difficulty of draining the water from the rice with a regular pot or bowl often results in an undesirable smell so just follow the trends of the modern Japanese kitchen and add this one to your kitchen. Though designed for Japanese rice, you will also find this washing bowl to be quite useful for draining other foods such as fruits and vegetables as well.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ubivPRWnL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TIKUSAN","source_asin":"B0BHSRQZ8W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-616279","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHSRQZ8W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHSRQZ8W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
