window.products.push({"id":616405,"name":"VASAGLE Adjustable Recliner Chair with Footrest, 29.5 x 33.5 x 38.2 Inches, Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91P3tfnpafS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wrapped in neutral gray color, the inviting curved armrests and tufted backrests effortlessly render an elegant statement. Whether you’re relaxing fireside in a cozy den, sipping lemonade near a window in your living room, reading a book in your bedroom, or binge-watching on Saturday night, this adjustable recliner with 90°-160° adjustment offers a wonderful place for all relaxation seekers. Specifications: - Color: Gray- Material: Plywood, Metal Frame, Cotton-Line Fabric, Foam, Rubberwood Legs- Product Overall Size: 29.5″L x 33.5″W x 38.2″H (75 x 85 x 97 cm)- Seat Width: 19″ (48 cm)- Seat Depth: 20.9″ (53 cm)- Backrest Height: 20.1″ (51 cm)- Seat Height: 17.3″ (44 cm)- Armrest Height from the Floor: 24.4″ (62 cm)- Product Weight: 57.3 lb (26 kg) Package Contents: - 1 x Recliner Chair- 1 x Assembly Kit- 1 x Instructions VASAGLE Notes: - Do not expose this item to direct sunlight.- Never touch with sharp objects, which may cause damage to the product.- Do not stand on the chair or use it as a step stool or ladder.- Wipe the product with a dry cloth immediately after it gets wet.- Only used on level ground.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91P3tfnpafS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VASAGLE","source_asin":"B0BLV17Z83","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-616405","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLV17Z83","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLV17Z83","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":616406,"name":"Bodum Bistro Electric Burr Coffee Grinder, Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y-n57F0YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ask any coffee connoisseur and they'll tell you that in order for coffee beans to develop their full flavor profile, they must be ground right before coming in contact with hot water. This is where the bistro electric burr coffee grinder comes in and becomes part of the coffee making ritual. The Bistro is continuously adjustable - twisting the upper bean container determines how finely ground the beans will be. With over 14 settings from coarse to fine, you can deliver the ideal grind for any brewing method. But there's more to it than that. Most coffee grinders use plastic containers to receive the ground coffee but plastic and ground coffee don't go together well. The powder gets statically charged and spills all over the place. The new Bistro comes with a borosilicate glass container to catch the grounds. The glass catcher is inherently static-free, reducing the amount of overall static and \"jumping\" coffee grounds. This and the tight silicone/nylon lid make for an excellent, no-spill coffee grinder. The borosilicate glass container comes with a silicone band to make it slip-proof, an especially important feature when touched with wet hands. The Bistro is made from borosilicate glass, steel, plastic, rubber and silicone and comes in black, orange, red, green, and white.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y-n57F0YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bodum","source_asin":"B00430AXLE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-616406","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00430AXLE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00430AXLE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
