window.products.push({"id":616594,"name":"Champagne Stopper - Pumpable Champagne Saver with Date Markers to Increase Air Pressure and Seal Open Sparkling Wine Bottle 2 in 1 Champagne Cap - Spa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31aBJe6MIXL._AC_.jpg","description":"Features 1 x Silver Champagne Stopper 1 x Gold-Brown Champagne Stopper 1 x Wine Ring Made of professional grade materials Durable construction for easy long-term use Compact and easy to store Compatible with many champagne bottles Inflatable, keeps the opened champagne full of bubbles Whether it's a housewarming, a wedding or a friend's birthday, anyone will be ecstatic to receive such a cool and practical gift as a gift! Use our gift set to give your friends and family the easiest chance to start and end a party, which will definitely make a smile on their faces. HOW TO USE: Place Vacare Champagne stopper inside the bottle, close the locking clip around the bottleneck, and press the stopper on top to pump in air until you feel resistance. Refrigerate and enjoy wonderful fresh and fizzy sparkling wine days later. Add pressure after stopping the bottle by pumping air into opened bottles, simply push and release to inject air. Storage date dial allows you to set storage date reminders . High quality stainless steel and ABS bring the best results: 1. From now on, you will be able to seal your favorite Sparkling wine and make sure that it is not leaking (you can even put it flat in the refrigerator!).  2. Sealing is not enough. We added a built-in-pump to our stopper, to make sure that your wine's bubbles won't go to waste. 3. This stopper is designed to work with champagne bottles with corks, not twist cap bottles, and keeps open bottles of sparkling wine fresh and flavorful for 7 days. BE VERY CAREFUL WHEN YOU RE-OPEN THE SAME BOTTLE TO RELEASE PRESSURE. IT MAY BE SAME OR MORE PRESSURE COMING OUT THAN THE FIRST TIME! AVOID POINT THE BOTTLE TO HUMAN WHEN YOU PULL UP THE CLOSURE. DO NOT SUBMERGE IN WATER. CLEAN WITH DAMP CLOTH EASILY.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31aBJe6MIXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vacare","source_asin":"B07Y2P1WSW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-616594","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y2P1WSW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y2P1WSW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
