window.products.push({"id":616690,"name":"Chef'n G'rabbit Pepper Grinder (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41jZS9ZYOUL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Introduce your kitchen to a bushy-tailed friend with the Chef'n G'rabbit Pepper Grinder. This fun, yet sophisticated pepper grinder allows you to add flavor to your food with the use of just one hand. All you have to do is squeeze the ears to grind and remove the tail-like plug to refill. For your convenience, this grinder comes pre-filled with peppercorns. The new carbon steel rasps allow for a higher output level while the patented GrindTune lever on the base of the rabbit adjusts the coarseness of the grind to fit your spice specifications. To dispense, just squeeze the rabbit ears together; the internal grinder crunches and releases your spice from the bottom. A great addition to any style kitchen or tabletop, the G-rabbit salt and pepper set add a smile to your breakfast, lunch, and dinner. Choose smart, easy-to-use kitchen utensils that are built on tasteful design, new technologies, and the trusted reputation of Chef'n. Amazon.com Chef'n infuses its kitchen gadgets with a creative mind and sense of humor, such as its ball-shaped pepper and salt grinders with their rabbit ears and eyes. Now, the next-generation has emerged: the G'Rabbit grinder. This whimsical gadget with its soft-touch coating embodies not just the head but an entire bunny rabbit, from ears to body to cute button tail. Squeeze the ears together (one stays stationary) and you get the same excellent one-handed grinding control. Turn the base to adjust the grind from coarse to fine, so you can season with finesse any soup, salad, or stew. Remove the tail with its silicone seal to refill the inner chamber when the included peppercorns are gone. A matching G'Rabbit salt grinder in white is available to pair with the black pepper grinder. Together or separately, the G'Rabbit grinders make fun, useful gifts. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41jZS9ZYOUL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chef'n","source_asin":"B00138P8PK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-616690","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00138P8PK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00138P8PK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
