window.products.push({"id":616784,"name":"Reusable Cruise Smuggle Flasks, 9 Pack with Funnel – Non-Metallic, BPA Free Plastic Alcohol Containers to Sneak Booze – Collapsible, Undetectable – (3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LnUto35eS._AC_.jpg","description":"A refreshing sip of your favorite drink shouldn't cost an arm and a leg. Some events are too fun to miss out on but just looking at the prices at a menu makes your wallet quiver in fear. Other times you have to bring a drink you prefer that a venue doesn't sell and the security makes you throw it away upon entry. With Glone , all of these problems are conveniently solved using the Smuggle by Flask! Store your favorite drinks in our collapsible container and bring them anywhere with no problem! PRODUCT FEATURES Nonmetallic Materials for Easy Entry Through Metal Detectors and X-Ray Scanners Collapsible, Freezable, Floatable, and Puncture-Resistant High Quality BPA Plastic Material Odor-Proof and Leak-Proof Easy to Hide In Bag or On Your Person Perfect for Cruise Ships, Stadium Events, Concerts, Outdoor Recreation, and More Available in 8 oz., 16 oz., and 32 oz. 3 Pack of Each Size, Variety Pack Including 1 of Each Size, and a Massive 9 Pack, 3 of Each Size Available THE BEST BEVERAGE CONTAINERS FOR ANY PURPOSE Sometimes conventional bottles don't cut it. Their shapes maybe too large or too obscure to fit in the places you need them too. The Smuggle by Flask are completely collapsible and foldable into any shape you need. They can fit in tight spaces and are completely leak-proof and puncture-resistant so they don't break. They're perfect for fishing trips, camping, hiking, outdoor recreation, pool, beach, golfing, tailgating, biking, exercise, and a lot more! They're extremely durable and made using high quality BPA free food grade plastic that won't tamper the taste or quality of your liquid. A COST-EFFICIENT SUBSTITUTE No more spending triple prices for a casual drink at a luxurious event. Bring in your own beverage onto cruise ships, stadiums, theatres, and concerts without worry! Undetectable containers that won't be picked up by metal detectors or X-Rays scanners!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LnUto35eS._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Glone","source_asin":"B07NDKYPRZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-616784","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NDKYPRZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NDKYPRZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
