window.products.push({"id":616919,"name":"Velidy Bento Accessories Rice Ball Mold,Cartoon Panda Sushi Maker Mould Seaweed Cutter Bento Nori Kitchen Rice Mould for Kids PackedLunch Kitchen Tool","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513tMHRofwL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Bento Rice Ball Mold is a simple tool for making panda face rice balls or sushi. You'll have more fun making rice balls or sushi with this great value bento accessory pack. Enjoy kitchen time and food with your kids! It's sure to spark creativity and ingenuity in both of you. Features: -Reusable, durable, practical, fun, convenient and easy to clean. -The cat head shape is super adorable, and elevates a simple snack into a fun adventure. -Cute panda sushi mold is the best choose for you. Great for all ages to \"Wow\" them with your skills. Easy to Use: 1. Put the rice into the rice mold and gently press it a few times to form it, then gently pour it out, the panda's head is formed. You need to pack the rice in tightly before you press it down with the back, otherwise the rice is too loose and won't hold it's shape. 2. Put the seaweed or cheese slices, carrot slices on the silicone pad, and use embossed plate to press the panda's expression. 3. Finally, gently put the carved seaweed on the rice ball, the panda image is completed. Tips: For adding different colors of rice, it works best to separate a small portion of rice and add soy sauce (or whatever you want to use to color the rice)and saturate that small bit of rice until it is brown. Notice: - The mold should not be cleaned with boiling water at high temperature, which may cause deformation. Normal cleaning at room temperature is sufficient. - Not suitable for children under 3 years old, this is not a toy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513tMHRofwL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Velidy","source_asin":"B07JCTLB5F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-616919","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JCTLB5F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JCTLB5F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
